    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Now available\r\n2 bed/ 1 bath c. 72 sq.m in size with spacious south facing terrace overlooking courtyard. \r\n\r\nWestar Group are delighted to introduce Harbour Gate. This new and exciting development will consist of contemporary 1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartment and duplex homes located close to the heart of the thriving and popular commuter town of Naas, Co. Kildare. Naas has plenty to offer the prospective purchaser: a selection of top-rated schools locally coupled with excellent transport links, Naas is also well served with an array of shopping facilities, sports clubs, popular restaurants, bars and gastro pubs.\r\nHarbour Gate offers a perfect mix of rural tranquillity and modern convenience, it is located within minutes of the M7 and the Arrow Rail Link at Sallins and Naas town centre is within a short 5-minute stroll along the Grand Canal."
      },
